From the pre-beta feature+docs audit (epic be7ce156):
- package.json: drop docs/work/** from files[] — stop shipping maintainer
  local paths + internal project name to npm (843->425 files, 2.1MB->997kB) [56a3a16d]
- bin/forge.js: unknown command errors + exit 1 instead of the installer
  banner with exit 0; add regression test [b3bae4f3]
- status hint: forge docs workflow -> forge docs setup (dead topic) [95ddc997]
- board/test --help: drop stale Beads wording (kernel is default) [23ba0ea7]
- QUICKSTART: add npm install beside bun; Hermes listed as supported;
  section 6 validates the user's project (forge validate) not this repo [4a240274 00149f49 127e9bd2]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
